OL,3,ATyphoon Champi roars towards Taiwan
OL,4,Abringing heavy rain and wind
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaiwan is bracing for powerful Typhoon
OL,7,FChampi, which is set to make landfall
OL,8,Fon Friday with gusts of up to 173 kph
OL,9,F(107mph) and a 320km radius that will
OL,10,Fenvelope the entire island
OL,12,FTaiwanese authorities have urged people
OL,13,Fto stay away from coasts and mountains,
OL,14,Fand are evacuating residents on the
OL,15,Fnorth-east coast living near a
OL,16,Flandslide dam at risk of breaching in
OL,17,Fthe storm
OL,19,FScores of flights in Taiwan and
OL,20,Fneighbouring Japan have been cancelled,
OL,21,Faffecting thousands of passengers
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
