OL,3,ATyphoon Champi roars towards Taiwan
OL,4,Abringing heavy rain and wind
OL,5,
OL,6,FChampi is the latest in a string of
OL,7,Fintense typhoons as the Super El Nino
OL,8,Fheats up the Pacific Ocean and fuels
OL,9,Fstorms
